  - title: 03 / Diagnose both faults
    explanation: "Load the first case. Two-wire rises to 35 \u03A9 and Kelvin stays
      at 5 \u03A9. Choose LEAD FAULT. Load the second case. Both readings rise to
      42 \u03A9 and 12 \u03A9. Choose CONNECTOR FAULT. The drawing shows the second
      case."
    caption: COMPARE THE TWO-WIRE AND KELVIN READINGS
    parts:
    - id: positive
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.075, y: 0.66}
      label: BATTERY +
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.35, b: 0.42, a: 1}
