  - title: 04 / Verify the repair
    explanation: "Press FIT CONNECTOR. Kelvin returns to 5 \u03A9 while two-wire
      still reads 35 \u03A9. Press REPLACE LEAD. The readings return to 25 \u03A9
      and 5 \u03A9. The drawing shows the intermediate state after the connector
      repair."
    caption: VERIFY THE CONNECTOR, THEN THE FIXTURE
    parts:
    - id: positive
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.075, y: 0.66}
      label: BATTERY +
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.35, b: 0.42, a: 1}
